<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>companyresults expected in week ending March 14 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY---------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, March 13</p>
<p> Enterprise	F  **     PFT     151.3   142.6-157.0     101.6</p>
<p> Oil			     DIV	17.0    16.0-17.0	 16.0</p>
<p> Reckitt &amp;	 F	   PFT     316.5   314.0-320.0     285.1</p>
<p> Colman			  DIV     n/a	21.8-22.6	 22.0</p>
<p>				   EPS     n/a	50.2-50.4	  n/a</p>
<p>FRIDAY, March 14</p>
<p> United News     F	   PFT     284.5   280.0-290.0     104.5</p>
<p> &amp; Media			 DIV	n/a     23.5-23.75	23.0</p>
<p>				   EPS	39.7    38.8-39.2	 28.0</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>** Enterprise Oil's profit figures are after tax</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax and exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
